## 1. Mission

Implement the comprehensive content architecture and knowledge management foundation for Teranoo ERP Knowledge Hub.

This task is not limited to implementing a Markdown reader or a documentation website.

The objective is to establish the foundation of a long-term, publicly accessible, structured ERP knowledge platform capable of documenting the entire lifecycle of building an enterprise-grade ERP product.

Preserve the approved TASK-001 application foundation, visual identity, navigation, design system, localization, accessibility, and existing functionality.

Do not rebuild the application from scratch.

